  "_music": {
    "roles": {
      "tension": "Dark, tense and nervous: low synth pulse or muted sub-bass drone, ticking pulse on 8th notes, short staccato plucks, soft rising filtered noise. No full melody, no warm chords. The pulse gets denser and more anxious over time.",
      "release": "Light, airy and confident, like light flooding a dark room: soft piano or warm electric piano playing simple open chords, gentle plucked arpeggio, light and soft percussion (shaker, soft kick on every beat). Spacious and minimal. Feeling: relief, clarity, everything is simple now.",
      "groove": "Light rhythmic groove: claps or finger snaps on beats 2 and 4, a bouncy marimba or pluck motif, gentle bass, warmer and fuller harmony over time. Positive, easy, smooth, collaborative.",
      "build": "More energy and drive: steady kick, more bass movement, hi-hats, rising confidence. Still clean and light, never aggressive. Gradual build toward the finale.",
      "resolution": "The emotional peak and resolution: full but uncluttered, uplifting and bright. The main motif returns in its fullest form. Clear sense of invitation. Hold a final warm chord and let it ring, then a natural fade out."
    }
  }
